# `sumif` of timespans checks for overflow (DS4003), even alongside `sum`.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize ok = sum(1h), total = sumif(50000000d, isnotnull(amount))
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `sumif` does not fit in a `timespan`
  --> query:2:35
  |
2 | | summarize ok = sum(1h), total = sumif(50000000d, isnotnull(amount))
  |                                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: datetimes and timespans are counted in microseconds and hold about ±292,000 years
